&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: Belfast&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contract: Full time, Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EverQuote is seeking a forward thinking Senior Software Engineer to join our market-leading insurance lead amplification platform!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer, you will be at the heart of a platform that connects millions of American home and auto insurance customers to major and regional providers. You will be instrumental in the design and delivery of our main public facing platform and the sophisticated supporting tools that power it. Joining a highly capable, motivated, and fully empowered team, you will work in a fast moving, Agile, and data led environment where a &quot;test and learn&quot; mentality and A/B testing are core to our success. You will shine as a mentor, providing technical insight while being empowered to innovate in both solution delivery and developer productivity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agent First &amp;amp; Innovation Led:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an Agent First organization. You will be responsible for pioneering agentic workflows within our SDLC, leveraging Anthropic Claude to boost developer productivity. Our team is committed to cutting edge innovation, leveraging Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG), Model Context Protocol (MCP), and advanced analytics data aggregation to drive system feedback and continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Humble, Hungry, Smart.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and deliver high impact features for our main public facing insurance marketplace and internal toolsets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive innovation in UX and implement advanced AI patterns including RAG and MCP to enhance platform intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and mentor junior engineers within the team and organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion our Agent First philosophy by driving agentic enablement across our development lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize analytics data aggregation to create feedback loops for continuous system and process improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively engage with cross functional stakeholders including Product Managers and Architecture team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Criteria:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A third level degree in an Information Technology or Computer Science related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have 5+ years of professional programming experience including experience at a software product company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience in the following disciplines; supporting cloud platforms at scale (AWS), working with infrastructure as code, container orchestration environments (preferably Kubernetes) and observability platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on Back-End Experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proficient in Typescript.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are experienced in continuous integration and deployment tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable Criteria:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a security-first approach with a strong focus on secure delivery of application software and cloud infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with container based solutions such as Docker, Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proficient in deploying infrastructure as code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UI development experience (e.g. React).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud native services (AWS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering systems/applications at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serverless architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Microservice based architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous integration and deployment tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Everquote offers a competitive salary and total compensation package including bonus and a comprehensive range of health and wellbeing benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Statement on Fair Employment and Equal Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EverQuote NI is committed to ensuring equal opportunity for all job applicants and employees. We will not discriminate on the grounds of religious belief, political opinion, race, gender (including gender reassignment), sexual orientation, marital or civil partnership status, pregnancy or maternity, age, or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a registered employer in Northern Ireland, EverQuote NI complies with the Fair Employment and Treatment (Northern Ireland) Order 1998. As part of the application process, you will be asked to complete a fair employment monitoring form; this information is used solely for monitoring purposes and does not form part of the shortlisting or selection decision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EverQuote NI carries out background checks on all candidates offered a position. A criminal record will not automatically disqualify you from working with EverQuote NI Limited; each case is considered on its individual merits in line with our fair recruitment practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reasonable Adjustments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to ensuring an inclusive and accessible recruitment process for all candidates. If you require any reasonable adjustments or accommodations at any stage of the interview process, please let us know and we will work with you to arrange them.&lt;/p&gt;
